  "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-conde-nast-built-multimodal-video-discovery-with-amazon-bedrock/",
  "sourceTitle": "How Condé Nast built multimodal video discovery with Amazon Bedrock",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2beee5a70b51c9c271ee93efdea3f1c61a8dd98028f9c82b4d791018f93b75b4",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-03T02:22:37.735583Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T02:28:14.694869Z",
  "totalBlocks": 67,
  "translatedBlocks": 67,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8056e72e0db30d87",
      "translationZh": "Condé Nast 的编辑团队没有快速进行多模态视频发现的方法。他们平均每项内容发现任务花费 250 分钟，手动在超过 140,000 条视频的库中查找。他们依赖标题和描述来查找相关片段。在速度直接决定收入捕获的媒体环境中，这一过程在 Vogue、GQ、Vanity Fair 和 Wired 等品牌上造成了可衡量的运营拖累。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "654bd2c7f11c3b2b",
      "translationZh": "核心问题是结构性的：现有搜索工具无法查看视频内部内容。团队依赖机构知识来定位资产，当特定个人不可用时，这会导致单点故障。与此同时，未被充分利用的内容沉淀在档案中，因标题或描述中没有与编辑实际运行的查询相匹配的关键词而无法被发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49759f8883fa19b5",
      "translationZh": "为了解决这一问题，Condé Nast 与 AWS 生成式 AI 创新中心（GenAIIC）合作，构建了一个基于 AI 的多模态视频发现解决方案。该方案基于 Amazon Bedrock 和 Amazon OpenSearch Service，能够在视频转录、视觉元素和音频上运行基于意图的语义搜索。团队选择了 TwelveLabs Marengo 嵌入模型，因其能够原生地联合编码视觉、音频和转录信号。Marengo 支撑后文所述的五项功能。这使得发现时间从每任务 250 分钟降至不到 2 分钟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b7521b1dd9c703e",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将描述架构，解释为何选择特定的技术方案，并分享该解决方案所带来的业务成果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4da14487f54d3340",
      "translationZh": "为什么选择语义搜索（以及为什么选择此架构）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d014333242b0c6f",
      "translationZh": "当团队明确问题范围时，两个约束塑了解决方案的设计。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82d6937ed7d00d3c",
      "translationZh": "首先，关键字搜索根本不够。编辑团队不会搜索 “yoga_tutorial_march_2024.mp4” 这样的文件名，而是会搜索 “具有平静背景的初学者瑜伽内容” 或 “时装周幕后花絮”。搜索层需要理解意图，而不仅仅是匹配字符串。这直接指向了能够跨模态（视觉、音频、转录）捕获语义意义的向量嵌入。仅靠人工编写的元数据无法提供这种程度的理解。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af006fef19acd6c4",
      "translationZh": "其次，视频库规模足够大（超过 140,000 条视频），任何解决方案都需要将生成嵌入的昂贵、计算密集型工作与提供搜索结果的低延迟工作分离。单体架构会在摄入吞吐量和查询响应性之间强制权衡。解耦后，每个平面可以独立进行扩展、故障和演进。这一决策在回填处理过程中证明是必不可少的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f19a861b3d6363dc",
      "translationZh": "这些限制促成了解决方案的核心设计：由 TwelveLabs Marengo model 在 Amazon Bedrock 上生成的多模态向量嵌入，在 Amazon OpenSearch Service 中建立索引，并通过专门构建的查询层提供服务。该查询层将自然语言转换为向量搜索并返回精确的时间戳。我们通过 Amazon Bedrock 访问 Marengo，因为 Bedrock 通过单一 API 提供多种基础模型（foundation models (FMs)）。它还施加了 AWS 治理控制，包括用于访问的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)、用于网络隔离的 Amazon Virtual Private Cloud (Amazon VPC) 以及用于审计的 AWS CloudTrail。这种组合使团队能够采用专门的嵌入模型，而无需自行构建或运行自己的模型服务基础设施。对于向量索引，Amazon OpenSearch Service 提供托管的 k-nearest neighbor (k-NN) 搜索，具备多 AZ 复制和用于混合查询的元数据过滤。这使团队能够在不管理底层搜索集群的情况下，对超过 140,000 条视频进行低延迟相似性搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "613371017041c286",
      "translationZh": "解决方案功能",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc2a39abe58247fe",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案为编辑团队提供了一种与其视频库进行根本不同的交互方式。以下功能可通过该解决方案获得：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aca8e5a1d28c5b49",
      "translationZh": "基于意图的搜索：用户用自然语言描述他们需要的内容（例如，“初学者瑜伽内容”或“关于可持续性的名人访谈”），并获得具有精确时间戳的上下文相关片段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "902247eb4f4f6531",
      "translationZh": "多模态理解：搜索同时覆盖视频转录、视觉元素和音频。片段可通过所说的内容、展示的内容或听到的内容被发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa848870b9f1b9e7",
      "translationZh": "基于图像的查询：用户可以上传参考图像，以在存档中查找视觉上相似的内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8acbdb57f76e438",
      "translationZh": "容错拼写和意图解析：搜索层处理不精确的查询，并侧重于意义而非精确的关键字匹配。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f30916ff83facd8f",
      "translationZh": "时间戳精度：结果能够精准定位视频内的具体时刻，从而免除观看整段片段的需要。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a7e83803632994b",
      "translationZh": "以下图示说明了高层架构，展示了摄取与索引平面以及查询与服务平面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "feca0b77364bedbb",
      "translationZh": "图1：多模态视频发现解决方案的高层架构，展示了摄取与索引平面以及查询与服务平面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "01350c465e276b72",
      "translationZh": "架构演练",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c84fc487670b565",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案由两个解耦的平面组成：一个异步摄取管道，使视频可搜索；以及一个同步服务层，处理用户查询。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eb402dea9526fba4",
      "translationZh": "摄取与索引平面",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00baf562ddcbee1b",
      "translationZh": "当新视频上传时，将执行以下序列：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6cee0f78120ba34",
      "translationZh": "上传：视频落入存储源视频的 Amazon Simple Storage Service（Amazon S3）存储桶（图中的 Video Outputs）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6bc8ce98e74fecc",
      "translationZh": "编排：新上传会触发一个事件（图中的 Video Search Events）。该事件将视频的元数据推入摄取过程并协调管道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5d895d45c6e5ecc",
      "translationZh": "预处理：摄取服务验证视频并提取元数据（格式、时长、分辨率）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fba50cf39f6e1da5",
      "translationZh": "分块：同一摄取服务在 Amazon Elastic Container Service（Amazon ECS）上运行，并使用 AWS Fargate，将视频拆分为段落。Auto Scaling 组在多个可用区水平扩展，以并行处理这些块。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c57c99283b17f539",
      "translationZh": "嵌入生成：每个块通过 Amazon Bedrock 上的 TwelveLabs Marengo 嵌入模型使用异步调用进行处理。Marengo 生成多模态向量嵌入，捕捉每个段落在视觉、音频和转录维度上的语义内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c7c4f84c5097f47",
      "translationZh": "索引：生成的嵌入被写入 Amazon S3 存储桶以实现持久性（图中的视频嵌入），并被索引到 Amazon OpenSearch Service 集群中以进行向量相似性搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29773fbbbf9bb940",
      "translationZh": "该管道是事件驱动且端到端编排的。这使团队能够获得逐步重试逻辑、跨块的并行处理以及完整的可追溯性以便调试。这些能力是在初始的 140,000 视频回填过程中团队 heavily 依赖的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b88d29a9325b87d6",
      "translationZh": "查询与服务平面",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c060691f1bf0ef2",
      "translationZh": "当用户执行搜索时，将执行以下序列：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78442d3054e2bf9e",
      "translationZh": "请求路由：请求通过互联网网关进入 VPC，并到达外部应用负载均衡器（ALB）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc6a3bc779fb542c",
      "translationZh": "后端处理：外部 ALB 将请求分发到运行在 Amazon ECS 上且使用 AWS Fargate 的前端服务。前端服务通过内部 ALB 调用搜索服务。Auto Scaling groups 在多个 Availability Zones 中扩展两项服务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39561431a43b0bd3",
      "translationZh": "向量搜索：搜索服务将用户的查询转换为向量嵌入，并在 Amazon OpenSearch Service 索引上执行 k-NN 相似性搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "219c38611c342f7a",
      "translationZh": "元数据丰富：搜索服务从 Amazon DocumentDB（具有 MongoDB 兼容性）读取视频元数据（标题、缩略图、引用）以丰富结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5392a352b699ac95",
      "translationZh": "响应：相关片段和精确时间戳的组合结果返回给用户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c04b023e297794e3",
      "translationZh": "高可用性（HA）设计",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a96db9be873290b",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案在 multi-AZ 中全程部署。以下组件被部署以实现韧性：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d448d9ccb85520c4",
      "translationZh": "Amazon OpenSearch Service：在三个 Availability Zones 中进行同步复制（两个活动，一个待机）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b74790985ab3da9",
      "translationZh": "Amazon DocumentDB：在两个 Availability Zones 中的主节点和待机副本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3cb7352eaaad99f6",
      "translationZh": "计算层：摄取服务以及前端和搜索服务使用 Auto Scaling groups 分布在 Availability Zones，ALBs 在故障时进行路由。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2d812930c302ee5",
      "translationZh": "网络隔离：计算和数据工作负载位于私有子网中。只有外部 ALB 可公开访问，出站流量通过 NAT 网关。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "862a14f74258b592",
      "translationZh": "Condé Nast 在 2026 年 5 月举行了基准测试工作坊以量化影响。以下结果反映了 Condé Nast 在该工作坊中的测量值。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a47caf8fdd51731b",
      "translationZh": "内容发现时间降低 99.2%，从 250 分钟减少到大约 2 分钟/任务（在前述的 2026 年 5 月基准测试工作坊中测得）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "605de2b3b0bef90e",
      "translationZh": "手动视频审核工作量降低超过 90%。团队获得带有精确时间戳的目标片段，而无需逐个视频进行快进浏览（前述的 2026 年 5 月基准测试工作坊）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b1df72637d693c0",
      "translationZh": "估计年度运营节省约 800,000（基于组织内减少重复手动搜索带来的生产力提升，该估计来源于前述的 2026 年 5 月基准测试工作坊）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f045cb3b551102cf",
      "translationZh": "资产可发现性得到提升：之前未被充分利用的视频通过仅靠元数据搜索无法识别的语义关联被发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f2a77bc7417f3f2e",
      "translationZh": "收入捕获加速：更快的发现意味着对广告商请求和销售机会的响应更快，从询问到变现的路径被缩短。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e7bf109d75fd7fb",
      "translationZh": "AWS 团队，以及 GenAI 和 TwelveLabs 与会者，帮助我们清晰简洁地阐述了业务案例。我对在不久的将来实现工作流目标的更多进展持乐观态度。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d21c4f9934241104",
      "translationZh": "— Billy Keenly，Condé Nast 全球高级总监，创意优化",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94f347d8ddc971be",
      "translationZh": "在超过 140,000 条视频库中构建此解决方案凸显了超越架构图所能捕捉的实际经验。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e30e2c9523d7c6fa",
      "translationZh": "早期的用户研究塑造了整个嵌入和查询设计。团队访谈了编辑人员，以了解他们用自己的话描述内容的方式。这些对话定义了语义搜索的恰当抽象层级。如果没有这种基础，系统可能会为没有人实际输入的查询进行优化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "880c7454dffd0c5a",
      "translationZh": "将摄取与服务分离在此规模下被证明是必不可少的。每个平面可以独立演进、扩展和故障。该解决方案已在生产环境中运行六个月，而在摄取管道重新处理回填内容或接收更新时，生产搜索始终保持可用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfec41212b6ed159",
      "translationZh": "确定合适的视频片段长度需要经过深思熟虑的实验。短片段会丢失上下文。长片段会稀释语义信号。基于真实编辑查询的迭代基准测试引导团队找到了在精准率和召回率之间取得平衡的时长。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4cd7432c5b032ce",
      "translationZh": "在此规模下，异步嵌入生成是不可妥协的。对嵌入模型的同步调用将在超过 140,000 条视频上造成瓶颈。通过 AWS Step Functions 进行的异步调用使管道能够在不阻塞的情况下处理积压，并且这仍然是持续摄取的模式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bc6ab524dddb1d7",
      "translationZh": "从第一天就构建多可用区（AZ）可用性避免了昂贵的后期改造。对于编辑团队在工作日全程依赖的解决方案，即使是短暂的中断也会直接导致生产力损失。从一开始就构建此特性比以后添加更具成本效益。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95a3a21840ad0a55",
      "translationZh": "本文描述了 Condé Nast 和 AWS 如何使用 Amazon Bedrock、Amazon OpenSearch Service 和 TwelveLabs Marengo 构建多模态视频智能解决方案。该解决方案将仅基于元数据的搜索替换为跨视觉、音频和转录模态的基于意图的语义搜索。结果：发现时间减少了 99.2%，并在超过 140,000 个视频的库中实现了每年约 800,000 的运营节省。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b46dcf0e6cd8baa",
      "translationZh": "此模式适用于管理大型视频库的组织，包括广播商、流媒体服务、体育联盟和企业媒体团队。解耦架构能够随着多模态 AI 能力的演进，适应不同的嵌入模型和内容类型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f585370152468f51",
      "translationZh": "了解有关 Amazon Bedrock 的更多信息，并浏览 Amazon Bedrock 用户指南以获取实施指导。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "782137363b93f3c7",
      "translationZh": "探索 Amazon OpenSearch Service 及其 k-NN 向量搜索文档，以进行相似性搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55fc79cdc8ed22a2",
      "translationZh": "阅读有关在 Amazon Bedrock 上的 TwelveLabs 模型，以实现多模态视频理解。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02643f48ed1cc4a6",
      "translationZh": "查看 AWS Step Functions 文档，以了解编排的处理管道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6df639093b13d395",
      "translationZh": "联系 AWS 生成式 AI 创新中心，讨论您的用例，或联系您的 AWS 客户经理团队。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51df5582c3db4254",
      "translationZh": "要在 AWS 上开始多模态视频发现，请访问 Amazon Bedrock 和 Amazon OpenSearch Service。要了解 AWS 生成式 AI 创新中心如何帮助您的团队构建 AI 驱动的解决方案，请访问 AWS 生成式 AI 创新中心页面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba7ff81450e86e13",
      "translationZh": "使用 TwelveLabs Marengo 在 Amazon Bedrock 上解锁视频理解",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d1c3d5cac39ec7e",
      "translationZh": "大规模多模态嵌入：面向媒体和娱乐工作负载的 AI 数据湖",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f35d45d743dc5471",
      "translationZh": "我们想感谢以下贡献者在此解决方案上的工作：Shinan Zhang、Xiaoye Qian、Mario Monello、Jessica Malca、Elvis Joseph 和 Jason Janetzke。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
